Date: Fri, 23 Aug 2024 12:44:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] build: refactor CMake build rules

---
 qt5ct/CMakeLists.txt                        | 41 ++++++------------
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct-common/CMakeLists.txt       | 35 +++++----------
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct-common/config.h.in          | 37 ++++++++++++++++
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct-common/qt5ct.cpp            |  6 ++-
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct-common/qt5ct.h              |  4 ++
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct-qtplugin/CMakeLists.txt     | 10 ++---
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct-style/CMakeLists.txt        | 13 ++----
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct/CMakeLists.txt              |  9 +++-
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct/main.cpp                    |  5 +++
 qt5ct/src/qt5ct/translations/CMakeLists.txt | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++
